I looked at Caleb,wondering how much he talked to his brothers. I had been under the impression there was no real relationship at all,but they seemed closer than I anticipated.
“I’m glad to hear that,” I said and was then introduced to her friends,Mallory and Rachelle,who both smiled kindly at me.
