He followed us over to their cousins,Jane and Sophia. They were all smiles and greeted me warmly,offering to get me a drink at the bar. Caleb’s parents were paying for everyone tonight so we best take advantage,and I told Caleb he was all set. He left me with a kiss on the mouth and I watched him go.
“How long have you two been together?” Jane,the oldest of the two sisters,with chestnut brown hair and pretty blue eyes,asked.
